OL,3,GNEWSAThree taken to hospital after
OL,4,Alight aircraft crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people have been taken to
OL,7,Fhospital after a light aircraft crash
OL,8,Fat a Suffolk aerodrome.
OL,10,FSuffolk Police said it was called to
OL,11,FBeccles Aerodrome just before 12:10
OL,12,FGMT, along with paramedics, an air
OL,13,Fambulance and fire crews.
OL,15,FA police spokesperson said the aircraft
OL,16,Fhad been coming into land at the time
OL,17,Fof the crash and the area had since
OL,18,Fbeen cordoned off.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
