OL,3,GNEWSAThree taken to hospital after
OL,4,Alight aircraft crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe East of England Ambulance Service
OL,7,Fsaid it had discharged one patient at
OL,8,Fthe scene, while three others were
OL,9,Ftaken to the James Paget Hospital in
OL,10,FGreat Yarmouth, Norfolk, with minor
OL,11,Finjuries.
